@startuml sequence_child_flow
title Flow 2 — Child selects "J'ai faim"\nNo server required

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor       "Student\n(Élève)"        as S
participant "HomeScreen\n(Flutter)"    as Home
participant "ChildScreen\n(Flutter)"   as Child
boundary    "ARASAAC CDN\n(static.arasaac.org)" as CDN

== Phase A — Screen opening ==

S -> Home : tap "Je suis l'élève"
activate Home
Home -> Child : Navigator.push(ChildScreen)
activate Child

note over Child
  ChildScreen is stateless.
  No HTTP call needed — data is hardcoded
  from maths.owl arasaacId annotations.
  (11 NeedItems in _kPhysical, _kMental,
   _kHelpValidation constants)
end note

Child -> Child : build() → renders 3 sections\n(_kPhysical, _kMental, _kHelpValidation)

loop for each NeedItem in all sections
  Child -> CDN : Image.network(\n  "https://static.arasaac.org/pictograms/{id}/{id}_500.png"\n)
  activate CDN
  CDN --> Child : PNG image bytes
  deactivate CDN
end

Child --> S : grid of 11 pictograms\n(3 sections: J'ai besoin / Je me sens / Pour le travail)
deactivate Home

== Phase B — Pictogram selection ==

S -> Child : tap card "J'ai faim" (arasaacId=35559)
Child -> Child : _showPictogramDialog(context, item)

Child -> CDN : Image.network same URL
activate CDN
CDN --> Child : PNG
deactivate CDN

Child --> S : full-screen dialog:\n[large image] + "J'ai faim" + Fermer button

S -> Child : tap "Fermer"
Child -> Child : Navigator.of(context).pop()
Child --> S : grid restored
deactivate Child

@enduml
